@Host = https://localhost:44312
@Token = <your_jwt_token_here>

### Get All Notifications (Paginated)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/notifications/pagginated?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept-Language: ar

### Get Total Notifications Count
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/notifications/count
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept-Language: ar

### Get Unread Notifications Count
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/notifications/count?isRead=false
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept-Language: ar
